---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About GeoWork | An AI Search Visibility Agency" description="GeoWork is a U.S.-market-focused agency built to help brands get found, understood and trusted in AI-generated search results.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>ABOUT GEOWORK</div><h1>The search landscape moved.<br/><span class="accent">We're moving with it.</span></h1><p>GeoWork focuses on one opportunity: helping businesses become clearer, more credible and more discoverable when AI assistants answer customer questions.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button-purple">Get to know us ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="feature-row"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>OUR PERSPECTIVE</div><h2>Visibility is earned by being <span class="accent">useful.</span></h2><p>We believe a brand needs more than clever wording to appear in AI search. It needs accessible information, a clearly defined identity, strong content and independent proof.</p><p>That is why our programs combine sound technical foundations with buyer-focused questions, structured data, editorial work and repeated measurement.</p></div><div class="feature-illustration"><span>GEO.</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section soft-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>OUR PRINCIPLES</div><h2>We believe in <span class="accent">clarity.</span></h2></div><div class="grid-3"><div class="card"><div class="icon-box">◎</div><h3>Show the baseline.</h3><p>Define the prompt set and competitors before making claims about results.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box cyan">✓</div><h3>Use evidence.</h3><p>Focus on accurate information, credible expertise and transparent authorship.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box green">↗</div><h3>Improve continuously.</h3><p>Keep reviewing what AI systems display as platforms and buyer behavior change.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
